# S13-game: e1m5's long hall at 320x200, Classic, a still camera; the plain picture of
# "one division, rationed" (S13). S13-segments is the same with the `segments` x-ray.
#
# Under V3-07: "And one division, rationed."
#
# Assembly (S13): S13-segments over S13-game, revealed from the left edge by a vertical
# cut that crosses the frame between file seconds 1.9 and 2.5 (smoothstep) and stays.

map e1m5

duration 4.4
fps 60
size 1920x1080

preset classic
mode 320x200
hud off

camera fixed -1536,1432,200 0,90

xray game
